  {
    "id": "account-entry",
    "title": "Войти в PetFriendly",
    "module": "Account & helping",
    "body": "<div class=\"auth-intro\"><i data-lucide=\"paw-print\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><h2 class=\"screen-title\">Войти в PetFriendly</h2><p class=\"meta\">Ваша компания для прогулок.</p></div><label class=\"field\">Почта<input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label><label class=\"field\">Пароль<input name=\"password\" type=\"password\" required autocomplete=\"current-password\"></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary full-width\" data-go=\"nearby\">Войти</button><div class=\"auth-links\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-link\" data-go=\"email-register\">Создать аккаунт</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-link\" data-go=\"account-recovery\">Забыли пароль?</button></div><div class=\"provider-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"outline\" data-go=\"nearby\"><img class=\"provider-mark provider-google\" src=\"provider-icons/google.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Войти через Google</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"outline\" data-go=\"nearby\"><img class=\"provider-mark provider-apple\" src=\"provider-icons/apple.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Войти через Apple</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"outline\" data-go=\"nearby\"><img class=\"provider-mark provider-telegram\" src=\"provider-icons/telegram.svg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Войти через Telegram</span></button></div>",
    "actions": [],
    "parent": "",
    "layout": "page",
    "note": "Restores the existing Studio sign-in structure: one email/password form, direct provider actions and reset link. Browser-only design; no credentials are sent.",
    "toast": "",
    "form": true,
    "auth": true
  },
  {
    "id": "email-register",
    "title": "Создать аккаунт",
    "module": "Account & helping",
    "body": "<label class=\"field\">Почта<input name=\"Почта\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label><label class=\"field\">Пароль<input name=\"Пароль\" type=\"password\" required placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"new-password\"></label><p class=\"hint\">После регистрации нужно подтвердить почту.</p>",
    "actions": [
      {
        "label": "Продолжить",
        "target": "email",
        "variant": "primary"
      }
    ],
    "parent": "account-entry",
    "layout": "page",
    "note": "Email registration UI. Password policy and provider confirmation use the configured Auth contract; no new password policy is invented.",
    "toast": "",
    "form": true,
    "auth": true
  },
  {
    "id": "account-recovery",
    "title": "Восстановить доступ",
    "module": "Account & helping",
    "body": "<p>Укажите почту аккаунта. Мы пришлём инструкции для восстановления доступа.</p><label class=\"field\">Почта<input name=\"Почта\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label>",
    "actions": [
      {
        "label": "Отправить",
        "target": "password-reset-sent",
        "variant": "primary"
      }
    ],
    "parent": "account-entry",
    "layout": "page",
    "note": "Password recovery opens from the sign-in form and sends a generic email acknowledgment. No account-existence disclosure; visual fixture only.",
    "toast": "",
    "form": true
  },
  {
    "id": "password-reset-sent",
    "title": "Восстановить доступ",
    "module": "Account & helping",
    "body": "<p>Укажите почту аккаунта. Мы пришлём инструкции для восстановления доступа.</p><label class=\"field\">Почта<input name=\"Почта\" type=\"email\" required placeholder=\"name@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\"></label><p class=\"meta\">Если аккаунт с такой почтой существует, инструкции придут на неё.</p>",
    "actions": [
