    "toast": "",
    "form": true
  },
  {
    "id": "community-members",
    "title": "Участники",
    "module": "People & communities",
    "body": "<div class=\"context-summary\"><span class=\"context-avatar\"><i data-lucide=\"users\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><div><strong>Соседи с питомцами</strong><span class=\"meta\">5 участников</span></div></div><label class=\"search\"><i data-lucide=\"search\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><input placeholder=\"Найти участника\" aria-label=\"Найти участника\"></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"supplemental-row\" data-go=\"chat-direct-design\" data-member=\"anna\"><span class=\"context-avatar\"><i data-lucide=\"user-round\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"row-copy\"><strong class=\"name\">Анна</strong><span class=\"meta\">Организатор</span></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"supplemental-row\" data-go=\"chat-direct-design\" data-member=\"ulyana\"><span class=\"context-avatar\"><i data-lucide=\"user-round\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"row-copy\"><strong class=\"name\">Ульяна</strong><span class=\"meta\">Советский район</span></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"supplemental-row\" data-go=\"chat-direct-design\" data-member=\"kat\"><span class=\"context-avatar\"><i data-lucide=\"user-round\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"row-copy\"><strong class=\"name\">Екатерина Александровская-Лисовская</strong><span class=\"meta\">Центральный район</span></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"supplemental-row\" data-go=\"chat-direct-design\" data-member=\"maxim\"><span class=\"context-avatar\"><i data-lucide=\"user-round\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"row-copy\"><strong class=\"name\">Максим</strong><span class=\"meta\">Советский район</span></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"supplemental-row\" data-go=\"chat-direct-design\" data-member=\"mikhail\"><span class=\"context-avatar\"><i data-lucide=\"user-round\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span><span class=\"row-copy\"><strong class=\"name\">Михаил</strong><span class=\"meta\">Центральный район</span></span><i data-lucide=\"chevron-right\" class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><p class=\"empty-members\" hidden>Никого не нашли. Попробуйте другое имя.</p>",
    "actions": [],
    "parent": "community",
    "layout": "page",
    "note": "Community details → Participants. Tap a member to open the existing direct conversation with an empty composer; nothing is sent automatically.",
    "toast": "",
    "form": false
